(7487892, 1191796, 98565, '<td valign="top">I thought I commented during voting but something must have gone wrong... well here is my belated comment:<br/> <br/>This pictures just yells "Dorothea Lange" at me. Everything is perfect, his expression, the clothing, the location. Simply perfect. I rated this a 10.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the blue and the awesome score - 7,3 is quite reare nowadays but so well deserved! <br/>And Congrats to your brother too. I hope he''s going to be you model again in the future</td>', 'I thought I commented during voting but something must have gone wrong... well here is my belated comment: This pictures just yells "Dorothea Lange" at me. Everything is perfect, his expression, the clothing, the location. Simply perfect. I rated this a 10. Congrats on the blue and the awesome score - 7,3 is quite reare nowadays but so well deserved! And Congrats to your brother too. I hope he''s going to be you model again in the future', '2016-12-19 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
