(7488372, 1191855, 113591, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> how naughty of you to put such a happy photo in a Lange contest. This photo makes my heart lighter. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totally agree ;)<br/> <br/>I did a re-crop, on my iPad, hope you don''t mind. Wonderful smiles, I like smiles. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1192261" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192261.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192261.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1192261.png"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks guys, I also love a smile. The closer crop was just not enough "Lange" as the children were smiling already...<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by posthumous: how naughty of you to put such a happy photo in a Lange contest. This photo makes my heart lighter.   Totally agree ;) I did a re-crop, on my iPad, hope you don''t mind. Wonderful smiles, I like smiles.    Thanks guys, I also love a smile. The closer crop was just not enough "Lange" as the children were smiling already...', '2016-12-22 14:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
